    "describe_ch": "本課程藉由實習操作，使學生熟悉測量儀器操作、觀測結果記錄以及成果繪圖展現之多元方式，增進教學效果。\r\n\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "This course is operated the plural way by practicing, to teach students familiar with the measuring instruments operation, recording and achievement drawing represent, to promote the course effect.",
